      "text": "have joy in fruit of labors, D&C 6:31. the Spirit shall fill soul with joy, D&C 11:13. the Lord’s great joy in soul that repents, D&C 18:13. great joy of those who bring one soul to God, D&C 18:15. great joy of those who bring many souls, D&C 18:16. lift up thy heart and rejoice, D&C 25:13 (27:15). knowing peaceable things of kingdom brings joy, D&C 42:61. come to Zion, singing with songs of everlasting joy, D&C 45:71 (66:11; 101:18; 133:33). wise steward will enter into joy of his Lord, D&C 51:19. the Lord to crown faithful with joy, D&C 52:43. perfect fasting means full joy, D&C 59:13. laborer to be visited by lord, behold joy of his countenance, D&C 88:52. spirit and element inseparably connected receive fulness of joy, D&C 93:33 (138:17). in this world joy is not full, but in the Lord joy is full, D&C 101:36. call on the Lord that souls may be joyful, D&C 136:29. spirits of just filled with joy, D&C 138:15.",
